---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="About Ilyas Rufai" description="Profile and focus areas for Ilyas Rufai, a DevSecOps engineer and technical writer." currentPath="/about">
  <main>
    <div class="container article-layout">
      <section>
        <div class="article-header">
          <div class="eyebrow">About the Engineer</div>
          <h1>Building reliable systems with strong defaults and clear intent.</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="prose" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
          <p>
            I’m Ilyas Rufai, a DevSecOps engineer and technical writer focused on cloud-native security, secure platform design, and developer experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            My work sits at the intersection of platform engineering, developer workflows, and security. I care about systems that are easy to understand, hard to misuse, and credible under pressure.
          </p>
          <p>
            The goal is simple: make secure engineering practices practical, explainable, and repeatable for the teams shipping critical systems every day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
          <div class="eyebrow">Published writing</div>
          <div class="card-list" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            <article class="article-card">
              <h3><a href="https://rufilboss.hashnode.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Hashnode</a></h3>
              <p>My long-form engineering articles on my Hashnode publication.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="article-card">
              <h3><a href="https://dev.to/rufilboss" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Dev.to</a></h3>
              <p>Practical engineering and DevSecOps articles for builders and operators.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="article-card">
              <h3><a href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/author/rufilboss/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">freeCodeCamp</a></h3>
              <p>Technical education articles and hands-on security engineering guides.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="article-card">
              <h3><a href="https://reclear.io/blog/writers/rufilboss" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Reclear</a></h3>
              <p>Detailed tutorials and cloud security content built for real-world systems.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="sidebar">
        <h3>Focus areas</h3>
        <ul class="topic-list">
          <li><a href="/writing"><span>Platform Engineering</span><span>→</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/writing"><span>DevSecOps</span><span>→</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/writing"><span>Technical Writing</span><span>→</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
